{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/24eefbcb3c18bf578606cf7fe9aaf489.poster.avif?t=1772394385\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/24eefbcb3c18bf578606cf7fe9aaf489.webm?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/24eefbcb3c18bf578606cf7fe9aaf489.mp4?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/fa7874371b1031697f6aac6e07ba1f08.avif?t=1772394385\" width=459 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Towerbolt Discord for behind the scenes updates, to share your best speedrun times, and to connect with other players!\u00a0 (Discord link on the right column of store page)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/12791bbeb8385374869ecafa227bf936.webp?t=1772394385\" width=459 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/9f3616958d338915d681e26013593561.poster.avif?t=1772394385\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/9f3616958d338915d681e26013593561.webm?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/9f3616958d338915d681e26013593561.mp4?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towerbolt is a precision platformer with an emphasis on speed and fluid ascending movement.  Set in the far future where robots are waging war against humanity, play as a Bolter, an augmented half human, half robot super soldier, and break out of a futuristic Megatower prison!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/c12fd04fe44aebd48ac7666dc77ec17c.webp?t=1772394385\" width=459 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/e67f612ecea9da6a9ecaf933d992ceee.poster.avif?t=1772394385\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/e67f612ecea9da6a9ecaf933d992ceee.webm?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/e67f612ecea9da6a9ecaf933d992ceee.mp4?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor of the Megatower is equipped with deadly security lasers that will chase you as you ascend the tower.  Outsprint these lethal lasers every floor while avoiding other security measures on your climb to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/8c3d76605090d20520426e1e279bd5d3.webp?t=1772394385\" width=567 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/99c397042c6bfd2d4ed8d432ddad52dc.poster.avif?t=1772394385\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/99c397042c6bfd2d4ed8d432ddad52dc.webm?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/99c397042c6bfd2d4ed8d432ddad52dc.mp4?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towerbolt is designed to be easy to pick up with a simple one button control scheme, but leaves lots of room for mastery with a high skill ceiling.\u00a0 Master the Bolter Charge mechanic and chain jumps without touching to ground to build vertical momentum to ascend faster and finish levels with lightning speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/b821aebdf5c29e70823d11e13c51f5c3.webp?t=1772394385\" width=459 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/16c84412b9585087052c1fb6a6c3dcc2.poster.avif?t=1772394385\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/16c84412b9585087052c1fb6a6c3dcc2.webm?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/16c84412b9585087052c1fb6a6c3dcc2.mp4?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Towerbolt, speed is more important than being careful or precise.\u00a0 The only thing that will kill you is the big laser chasing you, and every alarm hazard tile you touch will speed up the laser instead of killing you.\u00a0 Making imprecise jumps and making mistakes is okay, as long as you're fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/64f82cd30f033b25098da10897136753.webp?t=1772394385\" width=459 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/73a1164dc63b32640c45c121a08039d4.poster.avif?t=1772394385\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/73a1164dc63b32640c45c121a08039d4.webm?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/73a1164dc63b32640c45c121a08039d4.mp4?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tower spans over 150 floors and features new obstacles that will challenge and test you on your path to escape.\u00a0 Each floor is a micro platforming challenge designed to be quick to try, retry, and finish to keep you moving fast throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/5ec8102daa650284ab81197f95e96ec3.webp?t=1772394385\" width=459 height=56 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional challenge collectables and personal rankings per floor.\u00a0 Replay previously cleared floors to collect missed collectables and to improve your Speed and Stealth Ranks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Built in accessibility options and modular difficulty settings with Assist Mode.\u00a0 Tune the laser speed to your liking or give yourself extra jumps!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant neon pixel art aesthetic   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious sci-fi story set in the far future  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It's Time to Break Free","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2559220/2d386ce47a7e1da8aa53c3f7e8819538e788848e.jpg"},{"name":"Bolter Charged","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2559220/a055c725c332c1c67f5648680869b7dc7b16ac27.jpg"},{"name":"Power Center","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2559220/f8fd435bdbb0cf32e278b0addf44b389ec0ecb8e.jpg"},{"name":"Transport Sector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2559220/8bb7bbf5daf81fce3e600a7fb1d0eeadd727d233.jpg"},{"name":"Gravity Scaffolds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2559220/08efb312e2048f90872f8d2738f3786f44b83f3c.jpg"},{"name":"Heatsink Spire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2559220/72e77ed9644b6ee12294e4b3bb71dd15ebf013b8.jpg"},{"name":"The Top","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2559220/6168f0f2273eb2e9d4aad2ca973614f1c99ac6cc.jpg"},{"name":"Lightning Fast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2559220/1cc5cf606dd9c07ba3099dd7e08ae80613c3ca9f.jpg"},{"name":"Ghost","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2559220/deb1420259f425862733a44b73589dbd49178d3b.jpg"},{"name":"Break Free","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2559220/1ca0a106dfc03f3bf7137ebc70987306a05604b9.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2559220?t=1772394385","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2559220?t=1772394385","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/222a268de1a6ad0d817fce28e8abeddf327d2548/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772394385","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/222a268de1a6ad0d817fce28e8abeddf327d2548/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772394385","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2624390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/24eefbcb3c18bf578606cf7fe9aaf489.poster.avif?t=1772394385\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/24eefbcb3c18bf578606cf7fe9aaf489.webm?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/24eefbcb3c18bf578606cf7fe9aaf489.mp4?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/fa7874371b1031697f6aac6e07ba1f08.avif?t=1772394385\" width=459 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Towerbolt Discord for behind the scenes updates, to share your best speedrun times, and to connect with other players!\u00a0 (Discord link on the right column of store page)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/12791bbeb8385374869ecafa227bf936.webp?t=1772394385\" width=459 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/9f3616958d338915d681e26013593561.poster.avif?t=1772394385\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/9f3616958d338915d681e26013593561.webm?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/9f3616958d338915d681e26013593561.mp4?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towerbolt is a precision platformer with an emphasis on speed and fluid ascending movement.  Set in the far future where robots are waging war against humanity, play as a Bolter, an augmented half human, half robot super soldier, and break out of a futuristic Megatower prison!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/c12fd04fe44aebd48ac7666dc77ec17c.webp?t=1772394385\" width=459 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/e67f612ecea9da6a9ecaf933d992ceee.poster.avif?t=1772394385\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/e67f612ecea9da6a9ecaf933d992ceee.webm?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/e67f612ecea9da6a9ecaf933d992ceee.mp4?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor of the Megatower is equipped with deadly security lasers that will chase you as you ascend the tower.  Outsprint these lethal lasers every floor while avoiding other security measures on your climb to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/8c3d76605090d20520426e1e279bd5d3.webp?t=1772394385\" width=567 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/99c397042c6bfd2d4ed8d432ddad52dc.poster.avif?t=1772394385\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/99c397042c6bfd2d4ed8d432ddad52dc.webm?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/99c397042c6bfd2d4ed8d432ddad52dc.mp4?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towerbolt is designed to be easy to pick up with a simple one button control scheme, but leaves lots of room for mastery with a high skill ceiling.\u00a0 Master the Bolter Charge mechanic and chain jumps without touching to ground to build vertical momentum to ascend faster and finish levels with lightning speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/b821aebdf5c29e70823d11e13c51f5c3.webp?t=1772394385\" width=459 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/16c84412b9585087052c1fb6a6c3dcc2.poster.avif?t=1772394385\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/16c84412b9585087052c1fb6a6c3dcc2.webm?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/16c84412b9585087052c1fb6a6c3dcc2.mp4?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Towerbolt, speed is more important than being careful or precise.\u00a0 The only thing that will kill you is the big laser chasing you, and every alarm hazard tile you touch will speed up the laser instead of killing you.\u00a0 Making imprecise jumps and making mistakes is okay, as long as you're fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/64f82cd30f033b25098da10897136753.webp?t=1772394385\" width=459 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/73a1164dc63b32640c45c121a08039d4.poster.avif?t=1772394385\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/73a1164dc63b32640c45c121a08039d4.webm?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/73a1164dc63b32640c45c121a08039d4.mp4?t=1772394385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tower spans over 150 floors and features new obstacles that will challenge and test you on your path to escape.\u00a0 Each floor is a micro platforming challenge designed to be quick to try, retry, and finish to keep you moving fast throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/5ec8102daa650284ab81197f95e96ec3.webp?t=1772394385\" width=459 height=56 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional challenge collectables and personal rankings per floor.\u00a0 Replay previously cleared floors to collect missed collectables and to improve your Speed and Stealth Ranks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Built in accessibility options and modular difficulty settings with Assist Mode.\u00a0 Tune the laser speed to your liking or give yourself extra jumps!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant neon pixel art aesthetic   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious sci-fi story set in the far future  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["bordenary